  "description": "You’re lost. And that’s a good thing because the Diamondback Haanjo 5 is a gravel bike designed to help you get off the beaten track. That’s why we built it around our trustworthy 6061 alloy frame and carbon fork with thru axles front and rear. The path off road is rarely flat and smooth. Accordingly, we outfitted this beast with plenty of gears as well as HED Tomcat wheels with grippy WTB Vulpine 700×40c tires. Finally, we’ve updated this ride to include SRAM Apex AXS eTap 1×12 drivetrain components and a Kind Shock dropper post, giving you more control when you need it. Looking for your next great adventure? When the road turns bad, this bike gets really good.",
